  "description": "COMFORTABLE, LIGHTWEIGHT AND HIGHLY RESPONSIVE\n\nBuilt like all BH high-end frames; we use Hollow Core Internal Moulding (HCIM) technology, allowing us to minimise the weight of the frame, which stands at just 1.050 g in the M size model.\n\nAIR BOW GRAVEL FORK\n\nIt features the Air Bow fork that has its own characteristic shape, which is maximised to enable a tyre width clearance of up to 45 mm.\n\nSRS ANTI-VIBRATION SYSTEM\n\nDesigned to absorb ground vibrations, to combine comfort and performance effectively without ever hindering pedalling.\n\nBUILT-IN COMPARTMENT\n\nAt the bottom of the down tube there is a built-in compartment to carry a small bicycle pump or CO2 cartridge. It is easy to open and you can even add a folded inner tube.",
